  "Langkah keselamatan dan amalan terbaik sebelum, semasa, dan selepas mengendalikan perkakasan.": "Safety and good practice before, during and after handling computer hardware.",
  "Keselamatan Diri (Anti-Statik)": "Personal Safety (Anti-Static)",
  "Sentiasa matikan bekalan kuasa (PSU) dan cabut palam dari soket dinding.": "Always turn off the PSU and unplug the computer from the wall.",
  "Gunakan gelang tangan anti-statik (ESD Wrist Strap) atau sentuh bahagian besi casing untuk membuang cas statik badan.": "Use an ESD wrist strap or suitable grounded metal contact to reduce static electricity risk.",
