  "100% Kebal terhadap gangguan elektromagnetik (EMI), kapasiti jalur lebar (Bandwidth) yang tiada tandingan, dan tidak berisiko kilat kerana tiada pengalir arus elektrik.": "Optical fibre is immune to electromagnetic interference (EMI). It supports high bandwidth and does not conduct electrical current along a glass-fibre link.",
  "kelajuan": "speed",
  "alatan": "tools",
  "peralatan": "equipment",
  "Rak pelayan (Server Rack) bersaiz standard 19-inci adalah nadi kepada mana-mana infrastruktur IT. Susunan yang sistematik memudahkan pengurusan, penyejukan, dan keselamatan perkakasan.": "Standard 19-inch server racks are important in IT infrastructure. A planned arrangement improves cable management, cooling and equipment safety.",
  "Susunan Standard Industri (Top to Bottom)": "Typical Industry Rack Arrangement (Top to Bottom)",
  "Atas: Patch Panel & Pengurusan Kabel": "Top: Patch Panel and Cable Management",
  "Ditempatkan di posisi paling atas kerana ratusan kabel utama dari siling (Horizontal Cabling) akan diturunkan dan ditamatkan di sini terlebih dahulu sebelum dihubungkan ke Suis.": "Placed near the top because horizontal cables arrive from ceiling pathways and are terminated here before connecting to switches.",
  "Tengah Atas: Suis Rangkaian (Switch)": "Upper Middle: Network Switch",
  "Suis diletakkan rapat di bawah Patch Panel supaya wayar fleksibel (Patch Cord) yang pendek (0.5m - 1m) dapat disambungkan dengan kemas tanpa berselirat.": "The switch is placed near the patch panel so short patch cords (0.5–1 m) can make neat, organised connections.",
  "Tengah Bawah: Pelayan (Server) & Router": "Lower Middle: Server and Router",
  "Menempatkan penghala (Router) utama, Firewall, dan komputer Pelayan. Ruang ini berada pada jarak yang selamat dari haba terkumpul di bahagian paling atas rak.": "Used for the main router, firewall and server. Leave suitable space for cooling and safe access.",
  "Unit Bekalan Kuasa Tanpa Gangguan (UPS). Wajib diletakkan paling bawah kerana": "Uninterruptible Power Supply (UPS). Keep heavy equipment low in the rack because its",
  "berat baterinya melampau": "battery weight is high",
  ". Ini memberikan kestabilan fizikal (pusat graviti rendah) agar rak tidak tumbang.": ". A low centre of gravity improves rack stability.",
  "Mengapa kita tidak menyambungkan kabel lurus (direct) terus dari dinding pejabat ke dalam Suis?": "Why don't we connect long wall cables directly to the network switch?",
  "#94a3b8": "Fixed Cable from the Wall",
  "Mencegah Kerosakan Port Suis": "Protect Switch Ports",
  "Kabel panjang dari dalam dinding adalah jenis 'Solid Copper' (keras). Jika ditarik terus ke Switch, berat dan pergerakan kabel boleh merosakkan (mematahkan) port Switch yang sangat mahal harganya.": "Permanent wall cables often contain solid copper conductors. Moving or pulling them directly at the switch can damage the switch ports.",
  "Fleksibiliti Penyelenggaraan": "Easier Maintenance",
  "Kabel dinding ditamatkan kekal di belakang Panel. Sebarang pertukaran pautan (tukar bilik/pekerja) hanya perlu mencabut kabel pendek 'Patch Cord' di hadapan Panel tanpa menyentuh pendawaian asal.": "Permanent cables end at the back of the patch panel. Connections can be changed with short patch cords at the front without touching the fixed wiring.",
  "Sistem Pelabelan (Labelling) Teratur": "Clear Labelling System",
  "Setiap lubang (port) pada Patch Panel dilabelkan nombornya (Cth: Port 24) supaya sepadan (match) dengan nombor soket dinding di meja pekerja. Ini amat pantas untuk mengesan masalah (Troubleshooting).": "Label each patch panel port (for example, Port 24) to match its wall outlet. Labels help technicians find and fix connection problems quickly.",
  "Pemasangan Akhir": "Final Installation",
  "Komponen & Pengurusan Kabel": "Components and Cable Management",
  "Kenali aksesori fizikal yang melengkapkan pemasangan rangkaian di kawasan ruang kerja pengguna untuk memastikan kekemasan dan keselamatan kabel.": "Learn which accessories create safe, organised network outlets in a work area.",
  "Ikuti langkah-langkah standard bagi mengelakkan kerosakan isyarat. Pemasangan yang kemas adalah kunci kepada kelajuan rangkaian gigabit.": "Follow the correct steps to reduce signal problems. Neat termination supports reliable Gigabit network performance.",
